    skos:changeNote """2012-06-25 10:39:07.0 [mpmorahan] Insert Concept 
add narrower relation (EL NINO SOUTHERN OSCILLATION [095a05c0-6220-4abd-9c1b-c4504a092d7d,22987] - ENSO [54330626-f9b4-4c34-949a-9be427fdf51b,39707]); 
""",
