   End_Group
   Group: Orbit
      Perigee: 235 ER
      Apogee: 265 ER
      Orbit_Type: LPO > L1 > Lissajous Orbit > Halo Orbit
   End_Group
   Online_Resource: http://ssed.gsfc.nasa.gov/waves/
   Sample_Image: http://nssdc.gsfc.nasa.gov/image/spacecraft/wind.jpg
   Group: Platform_Logistics
      Launch_Date: 1994-11-01
      Launch_Site: Cape Canaveral/Kennedy Space Center, USA
      Primary_Sponsor: NASA
   End_Group
End_Group"""@en ;
