    skos:changeNote """2023-02-15 16:57:44.0 [sritz] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (HAQES [0bba0556-f0b7-48ff-8b0e-d9b102e9b13e,1217439] - Models [0a184cdc-c074-4946-90a6-02f03c686341,1207199]); 
