    skos:changeNote """2013-08-05 14:01:40.0 [tbs1979] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (SUBDUCTION [0d43cb88-dd6d-40ac-b241-b628a39ed2af,105419] - TECTONIC PROCESSES [99b4792a-9ea3-4756-a4dc-b1b30c946b54,86001]); 
