        """2013-08-16 12:11:11.0 [tbs1979]  
insert Definition (id: null
text: The process that takes place at convergent boundaries by which one tectonic plate moves under another tectonic plate, sinking into the Earth's mantle, as the plates converge. A subduction zone is an area on Earth where two tectonic plates move towards one another and subduction occurs.
language code: en); 
""" ;
