        """2023-05-10 17:45:57.0 [sritz]  
insert AltLabel (id: null
category: primary
text: Leica CityMapper-2
language code: en); 
insert Definition (id: null
text: The world’s only hybrid oblique imaging and LiDAR airborne sensor for fast and efficient digitisation of cities. High-Performance Hybrid Urban Mapping Sensor

The Leica CityMapper-2 provides high quality oblique imaging and LiDAR from one flight, saving time and costs. It captures two nadir (RGB/NIR) and four oblique 150 MP images. Together with a new generation 2 MHz pulse rate LiDAR it breaks all barriers of urban mapping. The newly developed optical system is equipped with Leica Geosystem’s unique mechanical forward-motion-compensation (FMC), which allows to capture high-quality imagery even in difficult lighting conditions.
language code: en); 
""" ;
    skos:definition """The world’s only hybrid oblique imaging and LiDAR airborne sensor for fast and efficient digitisation of cities. High-Performance Hybrid Urban Mapping Sensor

The Leica CityMapper-2 provides high quality oblique imaging and LiDAR from one flight, saving time and costs. It captures two nadir (RGB/NIR) and four oblique 150 MP images. Together with a new generation 2 MHz pulse rate LiDAR it breaks all barriers of urban mapping. The newly developed optical system is equipped with Leica Geosystem’s unique mechanical forward-motion-compensation (FMC), which allows to capture high-quality imagery even in difficult lighting conditions."""@en ;
    skos:inScheme <https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concepts/concept_scheme/instruments> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Leica CityMapper-2"@en ;
    gcmd:altLabel [ gcmd:category "primary"@en ;
            gcmd:text "Leica CityMapper-2"@en ] ;
    gcmd:reference [ gcmd:text "https://geo-matching.com/digital-aerial-cameras/leica-citymapper-2"@en ] .

