text: There are two main versions of the HDF library: HDF4 and HDF5. These two versions are not compatible and support for both will continue. However, the support for HDF4 will be limited to bug-fixes and building and testing on new platforms; no new features will be added. There are also two main versions of HDF-EOS that are based on the HDF libraries. HDF-EOS2.x versions are based on HDF4 and HDF-EOS5.x versions are based on HDF5.
language code: en); 
""",
