    skos:changeNote """2013-02-14 10:37:31.0 [mpmorahan] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (STRATOCUMULUS LENTICULARIS [12adeea5-f3e7-4f72-a029-f1e52411de18,82251] - STRATOCUMULUS CUMILIFORMIS [5857260b-1de6-47c2-8f66-5c0dbac42e32,82235]); 
