    skos:changeNote """2018-11-13 06:00:52.0 [mmorahan] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (GCOM-C [18512c09-2590-4804-8b43-dd9caea53b5d,368261] - Earth Observation Satellites [3466eed1-2fbb-49bf-ab0b-dc08731d502b,344761]); 
