    skos:broader <https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concept/6175c78e-432c-4254-b442-40d3cf0f6b34> ;
    skos:changeNote """2021-11-17 11:51:22.0 [tstevens] Move Concepts 
delete broader relation (null); 
add broader relation (BT-67 [1bfe5750-3641-4ff1-b8bf-40deb163abf0,826032] - Propeller [6175c78e-432c-4254-b442-40d3cf0f6b34,835882]); 
