    skos:definition """THERMOMETERS are instruments for measuring temperature by
utilizing the variation of the physical properties of substances
according to their thermal states; can be classified as gas,
liquid-in-gas, deformation, electrical, liquid-in-metal, and
sonic thermometers."""@en ;
