   Sample_Image: http://nssdc.gsfc.nasa.gov/thumbnail/spacecraft/luna17.gif
   Group: Platform_Logistics
      Launch_Date: 1970-11-10
      Launch_Site: Baikonur Cosmodrome, Tyuratam, Russia
      Primary_Sponsor: U.S.S.R
   End_Group
End_Group"""@en ;
