    skos:changeNote """2024-03-08 11:47:02.0 [sritz] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (S-SAR [1eb26a7d-c9cb-479d-82b5-f065e0e6f604,1603422] - Imaging Radars [824070fa-da29-40fa-ba17-f3d60584bd4d,1594903]); 
