    skos:changeNote """2021-11-30 09:56:57.0 [tstevens] Move Concepts 
delete broader relation (null); 
add broader relation (MIR-PRIRODA [207e6805-2bdf-4954-8178-c4cd63ce2269,826056] - Space-based Platforms [b39a69b4-c3b9-4a94-b296-bbbbe5e4c847,835875]); 
