add broader relation (ISOTOPIC AGE [211d289d-fae7-4815-9f3d-28a5afc7b3a9,82367] - GEOCHEMICAL PROPERTIES [048df94e-841d-4f4d-a5c5-6683d1d07aa6,82357]); 
