<https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concept/2344d251-4a54-45b1-a241-c91c03740da6> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concept/0a184cdc-c074-4946-90a6-02f03c686341> ;
    skos:changeNote """2023-11-03 10:03:27.0 [sritz] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (LPJ-PROSAIL [2344d251-4a54-45b1-a241-c91c03740da6,1469333] - Models [0a184cdc-c074-4946-90a6-02f03c686341,1458976]); 
