        """2023-07-19 11:46:02.0 [sritz]  
insert Definition (id: null
text: Now with GLONASS, the IMO Wheelmarked Vector™ V103™ and V113™ GNSS compass series are known for their superb heading and positioning performance. With the addition of GLONASS, the V103 and V113 now provide a more robust solution in critical areas where sky blockage occurs. The rugged IP69K design housing is sealed for the harshest environments. It incorporates fixed and pole mounting capabilities for both marine and land applications. The Vector V103 and V113 series of GPS Compasses are suitable for both dynamic positioning and professional marine surveys, as well as for machine control applications in agriculture, mining, construction, and other challenging applications.
language code: en); 
""" ;
    skos:definition "Now with GLONASS, the IMO Wheelmarked Vector™ V103™ and V113™ GNSS compass series are known for their superb heading and positioning performance. With the addition of GLONASS, the V103 and V113 now provide a more robust solution in critical areas where sky blockage occurs. The rugged IP69K design housing is sealed for the harshest environments. It incorporates fixed and pole mounting capabilities for both marine and land applications. The Vector V103 and V113 series of GPS Compasses are suitable for both dynamic positioning and professional marine surveys, as well as for machine control applications in agriculture, mining, construction, and other challenging applications."@en ;
    skos:inScheme <https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concepts/concept_scheme/instruments> ;
