text: The Search-Coil Magnetometer (SCM) measures the magnetic field fluctuations in ionosphere.

Main parameters:
- Band: 10 Hz - 20 kHz
- Magnitude: 5×10-4- 50 nT
- Sensitivity: 1 nT·Hz- 1/2 @ 2 kHz
language code: en); 
""",
