    skos:changeNote """2019-04-29 15:29:46.0 [sritz] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (RapidScat [275efdbc-5d2c-49c1-9e08-c2b50d2ff115,368721] - Scatterometers [563f30c8-43f8-48be-b649-4b548f877fa4,347211]); 
