    skos:changeNote """2024-11-20 15:17:58.0 [tstevens] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (VISIBLE SNOW DARKENING [27a8f83d-6fdb-43a8-bbdd-25a0ac9b3b5a,1905831] - SNOW/ICE [aa35a52f-e3d9-41bd-abd2-ec7e1a8101d1,1902354]); 
