    skos:changeNote """2022-10-04 08:26:07.0 [tstevens] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (LIF-NO [28367594-1412-44e9-849b-cc1b9f2244e6,1070166] - Photon/Optical Detectors [72227178-bb4c-4ff5-98a3-f976aa3f3714,1061783]); 
