""",
        """2020-06-25 12:14:09.0 [mmorahan]  
insert Definition (id: null
text: The WAF-P (Wide-Angle Fabry-Perot) Imaging Spectrometer, operating in the SWIR (Short-Wave Infrared) region, is based on a Fabry-Perot (FP) interferometer. The optical design of the instrument includes three lens groups, in addition to the Fabry-Perot interferometer, as well as beam folding mirrors required to fit the telescope within a microsatellite bus. The payload avionics includes a Q7 hybrid processor provided by Xiphos Systems Corporation.
language code: en); 
""",
