https://eoportal.org/web/eoportal/satellite-missions/e/ers-2"""@en ] .

<https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concept/2a1ec50d-e931-49d3-b45d-fc5108c4f92b> a skos:Concept ;
