   End_Group
   Online_Resource: http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Video_camera
   Sample_Image: http://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0b/Sonyhdrfx1.jpg
   Creation_Date: 2010-08-31
End_Group"""@en ;
