    skos:broader <https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concept/055a79c7-61db-4250-abad-f1e09909f14c> ;
    skos:changeNote """2017-06-28 12:07:51.0 [sritz] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (DMT UHSAS [2dc89734-7e34-4bf8-83c8-0e3d75f850e8,309749] - Spectrometers [055a79c7-61db-4250-abad-f1e09909f14c,288961]); 
