text: The Mobile X-band Polarimetric Weather Radar on Wheels (X-POW) is a Doppler scanning radar operating at 9.3 GHz with horizontal and vertical polarization. X-POW is used for detection and detailing surface rainfall rates and precipitation classification fields, 3-D precipitation microphysical retrievals, including water and frozen hydrometeor contents, and drop size distribution profiles.
language code: en); 
""",
