<https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concept/307def51-758d-4e3e-90a6-27d1603deb5b> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concept/3d25724b-832f-4a61-b0b2-4f2ccecdba94> ;
    skos:changeNote """2016-03-15 16:41:14.0 [saritz] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (2DS [307def51-758d-4e3e-90a6-27d1603deb5b,158671] - Chemical Meters/Analyzers [3d25724b-832f-4a61-b0b2-4f2ccecdba94,144709]); 
