add broader relation (IRNSS-1I [30fdce3f-f7c1-4dd5-96f5-8896972f4bff,1618406] - Navigation with Indian Constellation (NavIC) [b4013d60-ac0d-478f-b18f-0098caef0f78,1618401]); 
