   End_Group
   Online_Resource: http://eospso.gsfc.nasa.gov/eos_homepage/mission_profiles/docs/GRACE.pdf
   Online_Resource: http://www.gfz-potsdam.de/portal/
   Creation_Date: 2007-07-06
