add broader relation (Sea Ice Mass Balance Station [31e96f2f-9b8e-454f-a1f8-e8d791c13a33,368171] - OCEAN PLATFORM/OCEAN STATIONS [6ee1cf85-aa14-4fe9-a915-a8022830d8a7,345157]); 
