        """2021-11-18 09:13:00.0 [tstevens] Move Concepts 
delete broader relation (null); 
add broader relation (Sea Ice Mass Balance Station [31e96f2f-9b8e-454f-a1f8-e8d791c13a33,826112] - Surface [d93ffd52-5072-4736-b16a-cc4e5113e8b2,835898]); 
