   End_Group
   Group: Synonymous_Platform_Names
      Short_Name: Explorer 54
      Short_Name: 08353
   End_Group
   Group: Platform_Associated_Instruments
      Short_Name: MASS SPECTROMETERS
   End_Group
   Creation_Date: 2007-08-22
