    skos:changeNote """2024-03-04 14:05:05.0 [tstevens] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (CPF [3617149b-7c18-43cd-a280-a10996918567,1603398] - Data Format [8e770fe1-6e82-43aa-9f8a-75d217d7e6cb,1599392]); 
