add broader relation (RESIDENTIAL ENERGY DEMAND TEMPERATURE INDEX [37ae8d4e-fe97-43d3-b8ee-a597e4ebfe87,105827] - ATMOSPHERIC TEMPERATURE INDICES [25d73bcf-c8d4-4c0e-ac98-8f3e98677e73,105815]); 
