    skos:changeNote """2020-06-23 08:17:45.0 [tstevens] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (miniSEED [3b7e3e2e-8f14-4e07-a84c-00dc9750cc10,560410] - Granule Data Format [8e770fe1-6e82-43aa-9f8a-75d217d7e6cb,558797]); 
