    skos:changeNote """2020-08-12 15:04:55.0 [sritz] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (R/V Sally Ride [3d58c65d-cca7-4a69-a882-c18b801411c6,560590] - SHIPS [82a67b12-e99d-4c90-8a6a-a6f79d4c3c7b,542079]); 
