    skos:definition """LAPAN-TUBSAT is a cooperation between TU Berlin and the National Institute of Aeronautics and Space of Indonesia (Lembaga Penerbangan dan Antariksa Nasional/LAPAN). It was launched with an Indian PSLV on Jan. 10, 2007.

