    skos:changeNote """2021-02-26 13:12:58.0 [mmorahan] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (CIRC [3ebe0137-dcd0-41d1-96f5-3966884431c6,560887] - Cameras [d322ae9d-bde0-448f-948d-777aef096eb6,545823]); 
