    skos:changeNote """2021-05-10 14:11:37.0 [tstevens] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (Thermo Scientific SO2 43i Analyzer [402d661b-7ae8-4002-a227-99edb4f61f4e,606915] - Chemical Meters/Analyzers [3d25724b-832f-4a61-b0b2-4f2ccecdba94,598603]); 
