    skos:changeNote """2015-05-20 15:33:55.0 [aaleman] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (ACORDS [41d3528f-8029-4b1a-ae82-9279c7466219,157941] - Radar Sounders [6c5ca722-0bc7-4ccd-ad24-39b9d8710140,144655]); 
