    skos:changeNote """2023-07-21 12:12:42.0 [sritz] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (UWEC Auto [4369354d-2d49-4423-be9b-21c979963788,1380229] - Vehicles [8dc44d7b-e349-42ab-860e-18f5acfc1b28,1370479]); 
""",
        """2023-07-21 12:13:13.0 [sritz]  
