""",
        """2020-01-03 17:16:38.0 [sritz]  
update Definition ([Source: NASA ACE Mission, https://acemission.gsfc.nasa.gov/ ]

ACE will assist in answering fundamental science questions associated with aerosols, clouds, and ocean ecosystems, by making 
improved and more comprehensive measurements through the use of innovative and advanced remote sensing technologies. Aerosols 
measured by ACE include those of both man-made and natural origins, the latter of which is contributed significantly by ocean 
ecosystems.


