    skos:changeNote """2021-03-05 15:01:27.0 [tstevens] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (Alpha [4595fee4-25d7-41f3-abe0-73203138c243,560908] - Aircraft [227d9c3d-f631-402d-84ed-b8c5a562fc27,541399]); 
