text: ARIM200 Digital Air Data Probe (ADP) is an externally mounted digital-electronic air-data sensing system that is suitable for a wide range of different aircraft types. The ARIM200 Digital Air Data Probe (ADP) is a fully integrated, stand-alone air-data system capable of providing measurements of:

Barometric (Static) Pressure
Altitude
Air Speed (including TAS)
