    skos:definition """The degree to which a cloud prevents light from passing through it.
Optical thickness depends upon the physical constitution (crystals, drop,
droplets), the form, the concentration of particles, and the vertical
extent of the cloud."""@en ;
    skos:inScheme <https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concepts/concept_scheme/sciencekeywords> ;
