    skos:changeNote """2017-08-14 15:23:59.0 [tstevens] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (IRNSS [4c93cc0b-ca0e-4421-ac60-559b6390b89b,309923] - IRNSS (India’s Regional Navigation Satellite System) [bad22a08-f8ab-49b3-b266-005b21496626,309919]); 
