    skos:changeNote """2019-03-18 10:51:09.0 [mmorahan] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (TerraSAR-X [4dc63a97-144f-49f7-8fe2-2202857543f7,368577] - Imaging Radars [824070fa-da29-40fa-ba17-f3d60584bd4d,347803]); 
