<https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concept/4e7df1af-daec-4ee1-9e83-9f013d573fc1> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concept/3ef93fbf-1e19-42a9-a91f-502d125dbb7c> ;
    skos:changeNote """2021-11-30 12:08:57.0 [tstevens] Move Concepts 
delete broader relation (null); 
add broader relation (SRL-2 [4e7df1af-daec-4ee1-9e83-9f013d573fc1,826230] - Space-based Platforms [b39a69b4-c3b9-4a94-b296-bbbbe5e4c847,835875]); 
