    skos:changeNote """2021-03-29 12:26:03.0 [tstevens] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (NPN [522c7bf2-c8dd-42be-8596-742ccea0f99d,578380] - WEATHER STATIONS/NETWORKS [57b7373d-5c21-4abb-8097-a410adc2a074,565699]); 
