    skos:changeNote """2021-11-18 12:47:20.0 [tstevens] Move Concepts 
delete broader relation (null); 
add broader relation (OKEAN-O [53d5ea21-07bb-44b5-88e6-3775e90ca528,826253] - Space-based Platforms [b39a69b4-c3b9-4a94-b296-bbbbe5e4c847,835875]); 
