    skos:changeNote """2021-11-17 14:02:29.0 [tstevens] Move Concepts 
delete broader relation (null); 
add broader relation (IRIS-GSN [5423963b-822b-4eac-8442-c9fab383f5e8,826255] - Permanent Land Sites [0ec10fd9-492c-498a-b6d8-e2840cc3643b,835887]); 
