text: The Kestrel 4500 Pocket Weather Tracker was Kestrel's flagship meter. Capable of monitoring and reporting an exhaustive list of environmental parameters – from temperature to barometric pressure, dewpoint, wind chill, and more, the Kestrel 4500 was the most feature-rich pocket weather meter in the entire Kestrel catalog.  Was also available with Bluetooth Technology, allowing you to communicate wirelessly and transmit and log your data automatically.
