    skos:definition """[Summary provided by the Brazil National Institute for Space Research (INPE),
http://www.cbers.inpe.br/en/programas/cbers3-4.htm ] 

The PanMux Camera (PANMUX) is a high resolution camera that will be found on the CBERS-3 and 4 satellite.  Brazilian participation in this program will be enlarged up to 50%, thus taking Brazil to a condition of equality with its partner. CBERS-3 is expected to be launched in 2009, CBERS-4 in 2011. CBERS-3 and 4 satellites represent an evolution of CBERS-1 and 2.


