    skos:changeNote """2013-02-14 14:13:53.0 [mpmorahan] Move Concepts 
delete broader relation (null); 
add broader relation (CLOUD EMISSIVITY [576b5025-dc0e-4021-b8ff-6a7699a79b0c,62015] - CLOUD RADIATIVE TRANSFER [3487d350-a5a5-43d9-a60d-c1407dd2f0ce,82135]); 
