    skos:changeNote """2012-06-26 14:07:48.0 [gee-cee] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (POLLEN [59719c53-a2b7-4200-9b3c-dfa5d39607f7,39967] - BIOLOGICAL RECORDS [5553fe9d-ab0a-4305-86a6-1f7f697e15e4,39951]); 
