    skos:changeNote """2021-04-09 15:25:37.0 [tstevens] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (TROPICS/02 [5f2b1f43-f737-4236-8231-5f89d1802cf6,578388] - Earth Observation Satellites [3466eed1-2fbb-49bf-ab0b-dc08731d502b,565556]); 
""",
