<https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concept/5f8418fd-1a24-4b72-a3c9-8fc907366abf> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concept/1707b0ef-5e6f-4abc-bd7b-905c4ea18ba7> ;
    skos:changeNote """2015-12-28 14:42:36.0 [aaleman] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (AIRGrav [5f8418fd-1a24-4b72-a3c9-8fc907366abf,158583] - Gravimeters [1707b0ef-5e6f-4abc-bd7b-905c4ea18ba7,145151]); 
