    skos:changeNote """2020-07-21 08:02:46.0 [tstevens] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (AIMMS [61435b17-dde2-4254-9e22-dc8cf7db3cb2,560546] - Current/Wind Meters [1b41692e-c7fe-4567-bed9-b938a7400462,543331]); 
