    skos:changeNote """2019-11-25 12:15:30.0 [mmorahan] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (GLISTIN-A [6306cc51-41a4-4b1a-af8f-e60adfb656f0,423551] - Interferometers [290dea0f-84a5-4397-bd44-cba490e06676,407311]); 
