    skos:broader <https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concept/59b97a6c-385e-40a2-8422-ecbdb6023c4c> ;
    skos:changeNote """2022-11-15 11:19:28.0 [sritz] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (R/V N [630723db-a296-4569-86ba-c29a2566ad36,1114337] - Surface [59b97a6c-385e-40a2-8422-ecbdb6023c4c,1104457]); 
