<https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concept/6312933a-1109-44a7-80c4-67d55cbbc722> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concept/055a79c7-61db-4250-abad-f1e09909f14c> ;
    skos:changeNote """2016-03-15 17:08:32.0 [saritz] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (HUPCRS [6312933a-1109-44a7-80c4-67d55cbbc722,158687] - Spectrometers [055a79c7-61db-4250-abad-f1e09909f14c,144697]); 
""",
        """2016-03-15 17:09:13.0 [saritz] S. Ritz added instrument at the request of ASDC DAAC. 
insert AltLabel (id: null
text: Harvard University Picarro Cavity Ring Down Spectrometer (HUPCRS)
language code: en); 
""",
        """2024-12-13 12:43:49.0 [tstevens]  
insert Definition (id: null
text: The instrument measures ClO and BrO in situ via a two-step process: chemical conversion to Cl and Br atoms via a rapid bimolecular reaction with NO, followed by atomic resonance fluorescence detection of Cl and Br in the vacuum ultraviolet. The instrument is located in the superpod forebody of the ER-2. The flow of ambient air through the instrument is controlled by a single primary bypass duct from which the laminar core is extracted and decelerated into two nested, mirror-image secondary ducts each with two axes for the detection of halogen radical species. The 4-axis design enables multiple ClO and BrO detectors to be present on each flight.
language code: en); 
""" ;
    skos:definition "The instrument measures ClO and BrO in situ via a two-step process: chemical conversion to Cl and Br atoms via a rapid bimolecular reaction with NO, followed by atomic resonance fluorescence detection of Cl and Br in the vacuum ultraviolet. The instrument is located in the superpod forebody of the ER-2. The flow of ambient air through the instrument is controlled by a single primary bypass duct from which the laminar core is extracted and decelerated into two nested, mirror-image secondary ducts each with two axes for the detection of halogen radical species. The 4-axis design enables multiple ClO and BrO detectors to be present on each flight."@en ;
    skos:inScheme <https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concepts/concept_scheme/instruments> ;
    skos:prefLabel "HUPCRS"@en ;
    gcmd:altLabel [ gcmd:category "primary"@en ;
            gcmd:text "Harvard University Picarro Cavity Ring Down Spectrometer (HUPCRS)"@en ] ;
    gcmd:reference [ gcmd:text "https://espo.nasa.gov/tc4/instrument/Harvard_University_Picarro_Cavity_Ring_Down_Spectrometer"@en ] .

<https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concept/6314f68a-1f00-4e6d-9f06-b3e2ce4348e8> a skos:Concept ;
