    skos:changeNote """2021-11-30 12:05:44.0 [tstevens] Move Concepts 
delete broader relation (null); 
add broader relation (STS-56 [6462dbc4-9b1f-4cb4-9ae1-8eed8bf3f17c,826316] - Space-based Platforms [b39a69b4-c3b9-4a94-b296-bbbbe5e4c847,835875]); 
