    skos:changeNote """2024-10-17 10:31:11.0 [sritz] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (Libera Wide Field of View Camera [67d4cdd7-cfa6-440e-82f9-423098d0b11c,1860348] - Photon/Optical Detectors [72227178-bb4c-4ff5-98a3-f976aa3f3714,1851656]); 
