    skos:definition """A Ozone Detector is typically used in areas around ozone
generators, gas chambers, vent gas (post-destruct) systems, gas
delivery systems, and inside semiconductor tools. In most of
these environments an ozone detector is required in order to
comply OSHA/TLV requirements.

Additional information available at
"http://www.inusacorp.com/ozone_detector_d.html"

[Summary provided by InUSA]"""@en ;
