    skos:definition """DROPSONDES are radiosondes with a parachute dropped form an
airplane carrying receiving equipment for the purpose of
obtaining an upper-air sounding during descent; also called a
parachute radiosonde."""@en ;
    skos:inScheme <https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concepts/concept_scheme/instruments> ;
