""" ;
    skos:definition """COLORIMETERS are instruments that use the form of absorption
spectroscopy in which a reagent bonds with the species of
interest and is added to a liquid solution, resulting in the
change in color of the solution; used for determining metals in
atmospheric aerosols."""@en ;
    skos:inScheme <https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concepts/concept_scheme/instruments> ;
    skos:prefLabel "COLORIMETERS"@en ;
