    skos:definition """Aerosol collectors are devices used to measure aerosols usually deposited 
directly onto films or sensitive detectors. Collectors can measure varying 
sizes of aerosols depending on the application. Some aerosol collectors are 
ground-based, while others are aircraft-based or even placed on buoys."""@en ;
