    skos:definition """The OCM-2 sensor consists of 8-band modular cameras operating in the Visible-Near IR spectral range. This sensor provides an instantaneous geometric field of view of 360 m and covers a swath width of 1420 km. The wide swath enables the OCM-2 to provide a revisit cycle of two days for a given area.


