    skos:broader <https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concept/8e770fe1-6e82-43aa-9f8a-75d217d7e6cb> ;
    skos:changeNote """2020-06-23 12:49:12.0 [tstevens] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (VPF [75ce5e67-f1c3-4a53-bad3-34ba6f104a8c,560460] - Granule Data Format [8e770fe1-6e82-43aa-9f8a-75d217d7e6cb,558797]); 
