    skos:definition """Consists of various time parameters measured during an aircraft flight,
including computer clock time and GPS time:<br>\r
- syncclock_time = time found at the syncclock (VSI-SYnCCLOCK-32) in\r
seconds from first file name<br>\r
- syncclock_m_time = time found at the syncclock (VSI-SYnCCLOCK-32) in\r
Matlab dateform format<br>\r
- system_time = system time  in seconds from first file name<br>\r
- system_m_time = system time in dateform format<br>\r
- gps_time = time found at the GPS unit in seconds from first file name<br>\r
- gps_m_time = time found at GPS unit in dateform<br>\r
- cmos_time = time found at the computer CMOS in seconds from first file\r
name<br>\r
- cmos_m_time = time found at the computer CMOS in dateform"""@en ;
