interference patterns (electrical or acoustic activity that can
disturb or obstruct communication) to make accurate measurements
of waves."""@en ;
    skos:inScheme <https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concepts/concept_scheme/instruments> ;
    skos:prefLabel "INTERFEROMETERS"@en .

