    skos:changeNote """2018-09-18 16:34:06.0 [sritz] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (SRTM C-BAND RADAR [7b241f5e-a68a-491a-830b-22ecf48a57e3,368119] - Imaging Radars [824070fa-da29-40fa-ba17-f3d60584bd4d,347803]); 
