insert Definition (id: null
text: The HMP155 Humidity and Temperature Probe provides fast, accurate humidity measurements across a range of conditions including tropical, coastal, and marine environments. Thanks to the warmed probe technology and latest generation HUMICAP® R2 sensor technology, the HMP155 delivers excellent long-term stability in the harshest environments, especially where measurements may be corrupted by chemicals, fog, mist, rain, and heavy dew.
language code: en); 
