add broader relation (ABSOLUTE DYNAMIC TOPOGRAPHY [7e1fc68e-5a7e-4a59-8ae6-3fa15bdae12d,778237] - DYNAMIC TOPOGRAPHY [940550d2-1d9f-4c28-b9ba-857c2dc8ef95,778236]); 
