add broader relation (PALMER DROUGHT CROP MOISTURE INDEX [7e26f9e3-4c20-453d-bbc6-1970eca1ffb8,22601] - LAND SURFACE/AGRICULTURE INDICATORS [112e71ec-c0a1-49a8-82d7-bcb317b45860,39835]); 
