    skos:changeNote """2022-09-02 12:18:58.0 [sritz] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (RO3QET [7e3dbafa-6d45-4987-b244-329b72d44c6a,1040767] - Lidar/Laser Sounders [7c13f166-8711-4d2f-9251-4635002c6c31,1032463]); 
