      Short_Name: DMSP 5D-2/F7
   End_Group
   Online_Resource: http://nssdc.gsfc.nasa.gov/nmc/experimentDisplay.do?id=1983-113A-06
   Creation_Date: 2008-10-02
   Group: Instrument_Logistics
      Instrument_Owner: Department of Defense-Department of the Air Force (United States)
   End_Group
End_Group"""@en ;
