    gcmd:reference [ gcmd:text "NAV420 Series Owner's Manual, Document 7430-0121-01, Preliminary, September 2004, https://www.spp.co.jp/sssj/nav420manual_prelim.pdf"@en ] .

<https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concept/80e34388-3d24-4ff9-8d23-784fad52c432> a skos:Concept ;
