    gcmd:reference [ gcmd:text "https://ruc.noaa.gov/wrf/wrf-chem/"@en ] .

<https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concept/83eedf76-1354-4c80-9804-c2d0ad26b199> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concept/386ea533-9d98-4202-bad3-bb630ac39a93> ;
