    skos:changeNote """2023-07-19 14:35:17.0 [tstevens] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (InfraSnow [89caeef2-3ad1-4932-a3be-1a075c04afcf,1380225] - Photon/Optical Detectors [8143e95e-a438-4a2a-82b2-6d7ae079fba7,1371833]); 
