    skos:changeNote """2025-01-17 18:26:35.0 [mmorahan] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (MWIR [8b23a6ab-24bf-40af-a46b-1a77234af4c6,1966526] - Imaging Spectrometers/Radiometers [944b7691-af37-4fb4-9393-c114e7997829,1958017]); 
""",
        """2025-01-17 18:34:55.0 [mmorahan]  
insert Definition (id: null
text: MWIR (Mid Wave InfraRed) imaging sensor that captures heat emissions from the Earth's surface.

Each scene is captured with a ground sampling distance (GSD) of between 3.5 metres and 6.8 metres depending on the imaging angle. Specifically, the sensor measures the intensity of this radiation to determine temperature differences as small as 2°C or better.

Two modes are possible which allow for both daytime and nighttime image capture. At night, the sensor is sensitive to radiation in the range 3.7-5 μm; during daylight hours, a filter is applied to reduce noise from reflected solar radiation, giving a range of 4.5-5 μm for daytime imaging.
language code: en); 
""",
        """2025-01-22 16:53:36.0 [mmorahan]  
insert AltLabel (id: null
category: primary
text: Mid Wave InfraRed Imaging Sensor
language code: en); 
""",
        """2025-01-22 18:16:43.0 [mmorahan]  
insert WeightedRelation (id: null
related concept uuid: c5011ce7-f1a0-4a6c-924d-ca1c51d0c393
relationship type: null
relationship value: null
generated by: null); 
""" ;
    skos:definition """MWIR (Mid Wave InfraRed) imaging sensor that captures heat emissions from the Earth's surface.

Each scene is captured with a ground sampling distance (GSD) of between 3.5 metres and 6.8 metres depending on the imaging angle. Specifically, the sensor measures the intensity of this radiation to determine temperature differences as small as 2°C or better.

Two modes are possible which allow for both daytime and nighttime image capture. At night, the sensor is sensitive to radiation in the range 3.7-5 μm; during daylight hours, a filter is applied to reduce noise from reflected solar radiation, giving a range of 4.5-5 μm for daytime imaging."""@en ;
    skos:inScheme <https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concepts/concept_scheme/instruments> ;
    skos:prefLabel "MWIR"@en ;
    gcmd:altLabel [ gcmd:category "primary"@en ;
            gcmd:text "Mid Wave InfraRed Imaging Sensor"@en ] ;
    gcmd:reference [ gcmd:text "ESA Earth Online: https://earth.esa.int/eogateway/missions/hotsat-1"@en ] .

