<https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concept/9101d96a-4764-44c0-9f43-57205193f5df> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concept/225fb800-22b1-4d06-88ac-2bb391ac0906> ;
    skos:changeNote """2024-03-14 14:06:53.0 [tstevens] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (QZS-3 [9101d96a-4764-44c0-9f43-57205193f5df,1618398] - Quasi-Zenith Satellite System (QZSS) [225fb800-22b1-4d06-88ac-2bb391ac0906,1608031]); 
""",
        """2024-03-14 14:08:04.0 [tstevens]  
insert AltLabel (id: null
category: primary
text: Michibiki-3
language code: en); 
insert Definition (id: null
text: The Quasi-Zenith Satellite System (QZSS) is a Japanese satellite navigation program planning for a future evolution to the regional satellite navigation system in East Asia and Oceania. A two stage system deployment is planned. In the first step, is the launch of a single satellite (QZS-1) in 2009 for technical validation and application demonstration. The second step involves the launch of the second and third satellites several years later to demonstrate full system operation. JAXA and related research institutes are in charge of technology development and demonstration of GPS complement and augmentation from QZSS.
language code: en); 
""" ;
    skos:definition "The Quasi-Zenith Satellite System (QZSS) is a Japanese satellite navigation program planning for a future evolution to the regional satellite navigation system in East Asia and Oceania. A two stage system deployment is planned. In the first step, is the launch of a single satellite (QZS-1) in 2009 for technical validation and application demonstration. The second step involves the launch of the second and third satellites several years later to demonstrate full system operation. JAXA and related research institutes are in charge of technology development and demonstration of GPS complement and augmentation from QZSS."@en ;
    skos:inScheme <https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concepts/concept_scheme/platforms> ;
    skos:prefLabel "QZS-3"@en ;
    gcmd:altLabel [ gcmd:category "primary"@en ;
            gcmd:text "Michibiki-3"@en ] ;
    gcmd:reference [ gcmd:text "https://ilrs.gsfc.nasa.gov/missions/satellite_missions/current_missions/qzs2_general.html"@en ] .

