    skos:changeNote """2024-06-03 15:31:08.0 [mmorahan] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (FORUM [93ab70d3-9623-437a-b2c1-54b0f56e4de2,1708974] - Earth Observation Satellites [3466eed1-2fbb-49bf-ab0b-dc08731d502b,1698540]); 
