    gcmd:reference [ gcmd:text "Frenking, Gernot; Tonner, Ralf \"Divalent carbon(0) compounds\" Pure and Applied Chemistry 2009, vol. 81, pp. 597-614. doi:10.1351/PAC-CON-08-11-03"@en ] .

