    skos:definition """The Particle Measuring System Two Dimentional Cloud and Precipitation (2D-c) Probe records the two dimensional shadows of cloud hydrometeors as they pass through a focussed He-Ne laser beam in the size range 25-800 micrometers.

[Summary provided by Global Hydrology Resource Center, Marshall Space Flight Center, NASA]


