      Short_Name: PMS 2D-C PROBE
      Long_Name: Particle Measuring Systems 2D-C Probe
   End_Group
   Group: Associated_Platforms
      Short_Name: UND CITATION II
   End_Group
   Online_Resource: http://www.eol.ucar.edu/data/software/pms2d
   Online_Resource: http://ghrc.nsstc.nasa.gov/
End_Group"""@en ;
