    skos:changeNote """2012-06-26 15:12:11.0 [gee-cee] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (OXYGEN ISOTOPES [9713a1d5-8b03-4d38-b3b6-34578a1d5f39,40053] - OCEAN/LAKE RECORDS [5237fae3-c98e-4d4a-9013-d7c824b3862b,40027]); 
