    skos:changeNote """2015-09-23 19:54:19.0 [saritz] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (SENTINEL-1B [9940dbad-1a9a-4858-a0e8-af35b21277e2,158413] - Sentinel GMES [2c9f1fcc-d9c8-4c6d-b701-45c97cee511f,143381]); 
