      Short_Name: DCS
      Short_Name: Magnetic Field Monitor
   End_Group
   Group: Orbit
      Orbit_Type: GEO > Geosynchronous > Geostationary
   End_Group
   Online_Resource: http://nssdc.gsfc.nasa.gov/nmc/spacecraftDisplay.do?id=1975-100A
   Group: Platform_Logistics
