      Instrument_Owner: SW Research Labs
      Instrument_Owner: Los Alamos National Lab
      Instrument_Owner: Centre d'etude des Environnements Terrestre et Planetaires, France
      Instrument_Owner: Hughes Research Labs
   End_Group
End_Group"""@en ;
