    skos:definition """The Coupling, Energetics, and Dynamics of Atmospheric Regions (CEDAR)
   Data Base at NCAR/HAO holds data collected from airglow imagers and
   all-sky cameras.  None of the imager data are in digital form in the
   CEDAR Data Base and must be obtained from the contact person.  Video
   tapes from the imager at Millstone Hill are in the CEDAR Data Base.


Additional information available at
"http://www.nsf.gov/pubs/2002/nsf02070/nsf02070.pdf\""""@en ;
    skos:inScheme <https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concepts/concept_scheme/instruments> ;
