    skos:definition """[Source: NASA GHRC, http://ghrc.nsstc.nasa.gov/ ]

LNOM The LNOM model is NASA software which combines  detailed, flash-specific measurements of lightning with empirical laboratory results of lightning NOx production of Lightning Mapper Array and NLDN data to compute the vertical lightning NOx profile inside the analysis cylinder and the total NOx produced by each flash. 


Group: Platform_Details
   Entry_ID: LNOM
   Group: Platform_Identification
      Platform_Category: Models
      Short_Name: LNOM
      Long_Name: Lightning Nitrogen Oxides Model
   End_Group
   Creation_Date: 2012-01-30
End_Group"""@en ;
