    skos:changeNote """2021-04-09 15:53:35.0 [tstevens] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (TROPICS/07 [9f7b095a-94af-4ca3-8917-d1e1b8b99b80,578398] - Earth Observation Satellites [3466eed1-2fbb-49bf-ab0b-dc08731d502b,565556]); 
