add broader relation (SPEXone [9fdc317f-59a8-43ff-9d36-36e9719a7ea0,1395064] - Imaging Polarimetric SpectroRadiometers [018fded8-a186-45f7-a33a-b7ad5ebb853a,1387583]); 
