    skos:changeNote """2018-06-14 09:00:05.0 [mmorahan] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (Pleiades-1A [a0b1f332-41b9-4eec-8a9e-67778193a679,367715] - PLEIADES [516a9bb2-0171-4ad2-8d4f-3f7d1219d393,344967]); 
