      Orbit_Inclination: 98.55 degrees
      Equator_Crossing: 10 am Local time: e.g.
      Repeat_Cycle: 35 days
      Orbit_Type: LEO > LOW EARTH ORBIT > POLAR SUN-SYNCHRONOUS
   End_Group
   Creation_Date: 2007-09-20
   Online_Resource: http://envisat.esa.int/
   Sample_Image: http://www.dutchspace.nl/uploadedImages/Business_Fields/Earth_observation/Envisat/Envisat-in-Orbit-512.jpg
