text: The LI-7700 Open Path CH4 Analyzer features an open sample path that measures methane density in ambient air. The LI-7700 is designed specifically for eddy covariance flux measurements to evaluate methane emissions from the terrestrial landscape. It provides low-maintenance long-term operation in demanding field deployments.
language code: en); 
""" ;
    skos:definition "The LI-7700 Open Path CH4 Analyzer features an open sample path that measures methane density in ambient air. The LI-7700 is designed specifically for eddy covariance flux measurements to evaluate methane emissions from the terrestrial landscape. It provides low-maintenance long-term operation in demanding field deployments."@en ;
