<https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concept/a43850a1-7b00-4993-80ff-753c2b5c4015> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concept/f50672b3-13d8-4206-b6c9-a1f9891ea470> ;
    skos:changeNote """2012-06-26 11:05:20.0 [gee-cee] Move Concepts 
add broader relation (PALMER DROUGHT SEVERITY INDEX [a43850a1-7b00-4993-80ff-753c2b5c4015,20045] - LAND SURFACE/AGRICULTURE INDICATORS [112e71ec-c0a1-49a8-82d7-bcb317b45860,39835]); 
