    skos:changeNote """2013-03-05 10:21:37.0 [tbs1979] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (LUSTER [a4596f71-207c-4037-b3a1-7ab0cd12daec,82925] - GAS HYDRATES PHYSICAL/OPTICAL PROPERTIES [1f76b928-d41a-4fbd-9da7-b8602f0183bd,82915]); 
