      Orbit_Inclination: 98.44 deg
      Repeat_Cycle: 23 days
      Orbit_Type: LEO > LOW EARTH ORBIT > POLAR SUN-SYNCHRONOUS
   End_Group
   Creation_Date: 2007-09-12
   Online_Resource: http://earth.esa.int/SMOS/
   Online_Resource: http://www.cnes.fr/web/CNES-en/8042-gp-smos-to-provide-a-unique-map.php
   Online_Resource: http://esamultimedia.esa.int/docs/SMOS/SMOS_factsheet_22Jun09.pdf
   Online_Resource: http://www.esa.int/esaLP/ESAMBA2VMOC_LPsmos_0.html
