    skos:changeNote """2021-12-02 09:44:41.0 [tstevens] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (Project for On-Board Autonomy _PROBA_ [a9a057e8-bfee-464c-9c1f-1913c889caee,835942] - Earth Observation Satellites [3466eed1-2fbb-49bf-ab0b-dc08731d502b,826121]); 
