text: The counter-clockwise (CCW) or clockwise (CW) circulation of weather systems. CCW (cyclonic) rotation is considered "+" ... same as Earth; CW (anticyclonic) rotation is considered to be "-"; consists of two parts: relative vorticity due to curved flow and that due to wind shear.
