language code: en); 
""" ;
    skos:definition """AS350 B3e is a high performance, single engine, light helicopter manufactured by Eurocopter. The AS350 B3e helicopter, developed as a variant of the AS350 B3, is the latest member of the Ecureuil family. The new variant is designed for operations in a wide range of missions, temperatures and geographies.

The AS350 B3e can be used for wide range of operations including fire fighting, hoisting, news gathering, power line inspection, passenger transportation and law enforcement. The aircraft delivers best in class endurance, range and fast cruise speed."""@en ;
