    skos:definition """The Hobo XT Air Tempetature Logger is a match-book-size,  single-channel, 1800
data point capacity data logger for  temperature. The HOBO-Temp has its
temperature sensor built into  the casing. This logger provides a temperature
range from -40  deg.F to 253 deg. F and also has an external temperature
sensor. 

View image at 
http://arch.ced.berkeley.edu/vitalsigns/equip/tools/xhoboxt.jpg 

[Source: University of California, Berkeley]"""@en ;
