    skos:changeNote """2025-03-21 14:56:06.0 [sritz] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (GVR [b4286b92-417b-4f83-98c9-c86d44509d81,2118389] - Spectrometers/Radiometers [ecd58f82-8f96-45e1-9547-dd4a02291bd9,2110446]); 
