    skos:changeNote """2015-02-12 15:04:43.0 [saritz] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (STPSat-3 [b5e24e20-f99f-423f-83ac-d3eb5989ac48,106733] - Earth Observation Satellites [3466eed1-2fbb-49bf-ab0b-dc08731d502b,73425]); 
