Designation: 03000 / 67100A
Launch date: 18 Oct 1967
Country of origin: United States
Mission: Scientific (Sun observation)
Perigee/Apogee: 552/555 km
Inclination: 32.9°
Period: 95.7 min
Launch vehicle: Thor Delta #53

Out of service: Dec 1971
Decay: 15 Jun 1982

Additional information available at
"http://heasarc.gsfc.nasa.gov/docs/heasarc/missions/oso4.html"

[Summary provided by The Satellite Encyclopedia]


