        """2020-09-01 08:22:47.0 [tstevens]  
update AltLabel (Heitronics KT19 Infrared Pyrometer); 
insert Definition (id: null
text: The KT19 II implements the most advanced infrared technologyof the forthcoming generation.  New performance features bringadded functionality beneficial to difficult and complex appli-cations. The KT19 II sets unsurpassed standards inradiation pyrometry.  It is the ultimate high per-former for non-contact temperature measurements to cope with extremelyunfavorable boundary conditions.The magnitude of availableoptions and freelyselectable operatingparameters allowsideal adaptation forthe specific require-ments of all feasibleapplications.
language code: en); 
""" ;
    skos:definition "The KT19 II implements the most advanced infrared technologyof the forthcoming generation.  New performance features bringadded functionality beneficial to difficult and complex appli-cations. The KT19 II sets unsurpassed standards inradiation pyrometry.  It is the ultimate high per-former for non-contact temperature measurements to cope with extremelyunfavorable boundary conditions.The magnitude of availableoptions and freelyselectable operatingparameters allowsideal adaptation forthe specific require-ments of all feasibleapplications."@en ;
