IFOV: ? 51Ú from nadir
Swath: 1800 km (? 51Ú look angles) from 803-km altitude
Pointing Requirements (3Ã): Control: <0.3Ú (~1000 arcsec); Knowledge: <0.05Ú (~167 arcsec); Stability: <0.008Ú/s (30 arcsec/s)


