    skos:changeNote """2021-04-09 15:52:19.0 [tstevens] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (TROPICS/06 [bd1174ed-f4ed-463a-b372-de14e45d658b,578396] - Earth Observation Satellites [3466eed1-2fbb-49bf-ab0b-dc08731d502b,565556]); 
