    skos:definition """Broadband Hemispherical Field-of-View Multiple Spectral Channels
Infrared Flux Radiometer (HFOVR): Similar to the BBHSR except
that this instrument incorporates a long pass interference
filter and uses the field of view inversion method. Used to
measure infrared net fluxes.

Additional information available at
"http://www-indoex.ucsd.edu/publications/implementation/measure_sys.html\""""@en ;
