   End_Group
   Group: Orbit
      Orbit_Inclination: 98.80000305175781°
      Period: 102.0 minutes
      Perigee: 841.0 km
      Apogee: 855.0 km
   End_Group
   Creation_Date: 2009-12-23
   Online_Resource: http://nssdc.gsfc.nasa.gov/nmc/spacecraftDisplay.do?id=2006-050A
   Online_Resource: http://www.ngdc.noaa.gov/dmsp/
   Group: Platform_Logistics
      Launch_Date: 2006-11-04
      Launch_Site: Vandenberg Air Force Base, USA
      Primary_Sponsor: Department of Defense-Department of the Air Force (United States)
   End_Group
End_Group"""@en ;
