    gcmd:reference [ gcmd:text "https://www.eol.ucar.edu/instruments/vertical-cavity-surface-emitting-laser-vcsel-hygrometer"@en ] .

<https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concept/c2815464-48b7-4dc1-90d6-0ab5a8b7c82b> a skos:Concept ;
