    skos:definition """The Multi-Spectral Camera (MUXCAM) is an upgrade of the 20m-High Resolution CCD Camera of CBERS-1 and 2 Satellites.  Brazilian participation in this program will be enlarged up to 50%, thus taking Brazil to a condition of equality with its partner. CBERS-3 is expected to be launched in 2009, CBERS-4 in 2011. CBERS-3 and 4 satellites represent an evolution of CBERS-1 and 2.

