    skos:changeNote """2023-02-24 12:20:28.0 [tstevens] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (OLI-2 [c6c96647-5ff7-4407-992a-ff343ba158ca,1232202] - Imaging Spectrometers/Radiometers [944b7691-af37-4fb4-9393-c114e7997829,1223977]); 
""",
        """2023-02-24 12:21:53.0 [tstevens]  
insert AltLabel (id: null
category: primary
text: Operational Land Imager 2
