    skos:definition """The Surface Moisture Index incorporates remote measures of vegetation\r
condition coupled with radiometric thermal (temperature) data to\r
characterize surface moisture conditions. It is mapped using two\r
primary inputs; vegetation status as depicted by Normalized Difference\r
Vegetation Index (NDVI) and surface temperature."""@en ;
    skos:inScheme <https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concepts/concept_scheme/sciencekeywords> ;
