    gcmd:reference [ gcmd:text "https://directory.eoportal.org/web/eoportal/satellite-missions/content/-/article/cses-zhangheng-1"@en ] .

<https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concept/c830ad5e-ac31-41cf-b8e2-277fe457d76d> a skos:Concept ;
