    skos:definition """DISDROMETERS are instruments that measure and record sizes of
raindrops; it consists of a transponder that measures momentum
of individual drops as they fall onto an exposed horizontal
surface and the size is determined by calibration and the drop
size distribution (a tally of number of drops of different size
categories)."""@en ;
