text: The Water Content Reflectometer measures the volumetric water content of porous media using time-domain measurement methods.  The reflectometer connects directly to the single-ended analog input of a datalogger.  The datalogger period or frequency output can be converted to volumetric water content using calibration values.
language code: en); 
