    skos:changeNote """2019-12-12 12:04:10.0 [tstevens] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (CAS [d1be0e72-acd4-4fae-90b2-2eba8b91861f,532243] - Spectrometers/Radiometers [ecd58f82-8f96-45e1-9547-dd4a02291bd9,518851]); 
