<https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concept/d2903b14-616d-4425-b9ac-40e5c954821f> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concept/055a79c7-61db-4250-abad-f1e09909f14c> ;
    skos:changeNote """2020-06-22 07:47:29.0 [mmorahan] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (OCO-3 [d2903b14-616d-4425-b9ac-40e5c954821f,560394] - Spectrometers [055a79c7-61db-4250-abad-f1e09909f14c,543071]); 
