    gcmd:reference [ gcmd:text "Airborne ammonia measurements with a fiber-coupled quantum cascade laser, Da Pan, Hongming Yi, Lei Tao, Xuehui Guo, James McSpiritt, European Geophysical Union meeting, May 5, 2020."@en ] .

