    skos:definition """The effects of roll, pitch, and yaw, as well as jitter on  the image\r
geometry. <I>Roll</I> will cause the image to take on a wavy appearance,\r
<I>pitch</I> will cause grid cells to contract or expand in the flight\r
direction, and <I>yaw</I> will create a skewed image.	 <I>Jitter</I>\r
consists of random and	unsystematic vibaration which cannot be\r
measured."""@en ;
