    skos:definition """THERMISTORS are devices with electrical resistance that varies
markedly and monotonically and that possesses a negative
temperature coefficient of resistivity; commonly used in
meteorology and are composed of solid semi conducting materials
with resistance that decreases 4% per degree Celsius."""@en ;
