      Number_Channels: 8
      Spectral_Frequency_Coverage_Range: 12.5 μm, 18.7 μm, 20.1 μm, 22.7 μm, 23.9 μm, 24.5 μm, 25.2 μm, 28.3 μm
   End_Group
   Online_Resource: http://nssdc.gsfc.nasa.gov/nmc/experimentDisplay.do?id=1988-006A-05
