    skos:definition "TANSO-FTS-2 is the Fourier Transform spectrometer same as the FTS on GOSAT, with improved characteristic: 5 bands (instead of 4) with the spectral range of each band optimized based on the results of the utilization of GOSAT data, two bands for the TIR, the bands other than the TIR are divided into two polarizations (P and S), extension of band 3 to observe the Carbon Monoxide."@en ;
