    skos:changeNote """2020-05-22 12:29:57.0 [sritz] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (IMERG [ddbadcdd-36dd-4db8-98c6-c603bec96c76,560243] - Merged Analysis [6acce314-322f-4d58-9dcb-1f93457a9d86,541885]); 
