    skos:changeNote """2021-08-09 09:03:18.0 [tstevens] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (2B Technologies NO2 Converter [ddf9bc8b-2d0f-4a22-81c8-3b045cfbfbc1,706555] - Chemical Meters/Analyzers [3d25724b-832f-4a61-b0b2-4f2ccecdba94,698163]); 
