    gcmd:reference [ gcmd:text """Adapted from Brito, S. S., Cunha, A. P., Cunningham, C. C., Alvalá, R.
C., Marengo, J. A. and Carvalho, M. A. (2018), Frequency, duration and severity of drought in the Semiarid Northeast Brazil region. Int. J. Climatol, 38: 517-529. doi:10.1002/joc.5225"""@en ] .

