text: HDF4 is a library and multi-object file format for storing and managing data between machines. HDF4 is a very different technology than HDF5. The HDF Group recommends that, other than for working with existing HDF4 data, new applications use HDF5 since HDF5 addresses important deficiencies of HDF4.
