    skos:changeNote """2019-05-10 16:46:29.0 [sritz] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (KaRIn [e5c4d64f-fb76-40e1-84f0-d3019b70642d,368809] - Interferometers [992ffede-af18-49a9-8acb-2cd333860efe,348035]); 
