    skos:changeNote """2020-10-16 12:26:06.0 [sritz] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (PEROXYACETYL NITRATE [e66fdcc7-3a94-48a0-aa21-5964f9ddaf23,560743] - NITROGEN COMPOUNDS [9e5ec924-2fd3-4cbb-a7eb-ffde114d0cb9,83479]); 
""" ;
