    skos:changeNote """2019-03-12 15:27:48.0 [tstevens] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (ECOTOURISM [e6cf64ce-389f-479c-835a-eecd612d4d88,368559] - TOURISM [82fdb39c-4fe8-4e2b-9dcf-67ceb4c6d8b9,368555]); 
