      Short_Name: SSC
      Long_Name: Snow/Cloud Discriminator Special Sensor C
   End_Group
   Group: Associated_Platforms
      Short_Name: DMSP 5D-1/F4
   End_Group
   Online_Resource: http://nssdc.gsfc.nasa.gov/nmc/experimentDisplay.do?id=1979-050A-08
   Creation_Date: 2008-09-25
   Group: Instrument_Logistics
      Instrument_Owner: Department of Defense-Department of the Air Force (United States)
   End_Group
End_Group"""@en ;
