    skos:changeNote """2012-06-25 11:35:59.0 [mpmorahan] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (SOUTHERN OSCILLATION INDEX [eaa0bc43-e283-4bf1-ba20-ca32850a66ef,39713] - TELECONNECTIONS [b887d3e5-4280-43d2-a34e-0f63ac086b6a,20219]); 
