text: The European Space Agency’s (ESA) Atmospheric Limb Tracker for Investigation of the Upcoming Stratosphere (ALTIUS) mission will aim to monitor the distribution and evolution of stratospheric ozone in the Earth’s atmosphere. ALTIUS will provide support to services such as weather forecasting, and monitor long-term trends in atmospheric ozone.
language code: en); 
""" ;
    skos:definition "The European Space Agency’s (ESA) Atmospheric Limb Tracker for Investigation of the Upcoming Stratosphere (ALTIUS) mission will aim to monitor the distribution and evolution of stratospheric ozone in the Earth’s atmosphere. ALTIUS will provide support to services such as weather forecasting, and monitor long-term trends in atmospheric ozone."@en ;
