    skos:changeNote """2020-06-23 09:33:59.0 [tstevens] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (SEG-Y [ee05a43b-abfa-4955-847b-86cb590fba53,560444] - Granule Data Format [8e770fe1-6e82-43aa-9f8a-75d217d7e6cb,558797]); 
