    skos:definition """LVIS-GH
(NASA Global Hawk)

A smaller version of the LVIS instrument, known as LVIS-GH, is under development for use in NASA's Global Hawk unpiloted aircraft system.


For info about LVIS: http://lvis.gsfc.nasa.gov


