    skos:definition """The PMS/CSIRO is an instrument developed by Warren King (CSIRO) and marketed by Particle Measuring Systems (PMS Inc., Boulder, Co) for the measurement of cloud liquid water content. This sensor, commonly referred to as the "King" probe, is used primarily for the study of cloud microphysical processes and in icing studies.

Source: http://www.eol.ucar.edu/raf/Bulletins/B24/kingLwc.html


