    skos:changeNote """2021-11-18 12:41:10.0 [tstevens] Move Concepts 
delete broader relation (null); 
add broader relation (TIUNGSAT-1 [f1503638-4366-4025-8d27-6aefedc4c4dd,826893] - Space-based Platforms [b39a69b4-c3b9-4a94-b296-bbbbe5e4c847,835875]); 
