    skos:changeNote """2021-04-09 15:43:58.0 [tstevens] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (TROPICS/04 [f1594cda-7e89-4cab-8c6f-02ee081b59a5,578392] - Earth Observation Satellites [3466eed1-2fbb-49bf-ab0b-dc08731d502b,565556]); 
