    skos:changeNote """2018-04-05 14:51:32.0 [sritz] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (MASC [f59652c5-eaa8-49c0-b65f-a0166048b1dd,367479] - Radar Sounders [6c5ca722-0bc7-4ccd-ad24-39b9d8710140,347533]); 
