    skos:changeNote """2023-07-14 07:57:49.0 [tstevens] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (HyTES [f81fffc6-6742-4d69-b30a-c125fde64738,1380223] - Imaging Spectrometers/Radiometers [944b7691-af37-4fb4-9393-c114e7997829,1371941]); 
