    skos:changeNote """2022-09-02 12:52:58.0 [sritz] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (PAM Reactor [fb6a94d6-76be-4305-9a5a-b23d09736d63,1040769] - Chemical Meters/Analyzers [3d25724b-832f-4a61-b0b2-4f2ccecdba94,1032010]); 
