    skos:changeNote """2021-12-02 08:50:22.0 [tstevens] Move Concepts 
add narrower relation (COSMOS [0aee28fe-1c74-4743-8855-003bc1075174,825958] - COSMO-SkyMed Second Generation (CSG) [b359999f-bb1e-43de-ae6e-1e9dc44e752a,826657]); 
