    skos:changeNote """2015-12-10 17:15:20.0 [aaleman] Insert Concept 
add narrower relation (ICE SHEETS [10b1872b-4a48-4360-a449-388e8988bca9,84415] - ICE SHEET MEASUREMENTS [6d6a2b61-5d2c-4ec1-a164-34000f481588,158557]); 
