    skos:changeNote """2021-12-01 13:25:32.0 [tstevens] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (Solar TErrestrial RElations Observatory _STEREO_ [45ca37e2-2ca8-4562-b9f4-cec6b8251c9f,835933] - Solar/Space Observation Satellites [8e8b7689-0a8e-47a4-9c68-5f6a207104d5,826501]); 
""",
