add broader relation (OGO (Orbiting Geophysical Observatory) [e57b586f-09ba-45ad-868c-4c232d6034b4,826848] - Earth Observation Satellites [3466eed1-2fbb-49bf-ab0b-dc08731d502b,826121]); 
