add broader relation (SMS (Synchronous Meteorological Satellites) [9abcdc9a-6442-4e2e-848a-8b72b954896c,826541] - Earth Observation Satellites [3466eed1-2fbb-49bf-ab0b-dc08731d502b,826121]); 
