    skos:changeNote """2014-06-12 09:46:25.0 [mpmorahan] Insert Concept 
add narrower relation (INSAT (Indian National Satellite) [949ab40f-3954-4c81-a063-275d0e13a14e,73981] - INSAT-3D [5999e653-21ea-49ef-977a-13b5fe40fa36,106461]); 
