    skos:changeNote """2017-11-27 11:46:53.0 [sritz] Move Concepts 
add narrower relation (NOAA POES (Polar Orbiting Environmental Satellites) [e8baa3a4-ef5a-455a-bf25-d61e59fc9bb3,288767] - JPSS-1 [586db0b3-5f94-466e-b7c1-a2dbedc0c1fc,287835]); 
""",
