    skos:definition """Instruments that measure a phenomenon exactly in place where it occurs (i.e. without moving it to some special medium). Laboratory instruments refer to the various tools and equipment used by scientists working in a laboratory.   


Group: Instrument_Details
   Entry_ID: In Situ/Laboratory Instruments
   Group: Instrument_Identification
      Instrument_Category: In Situ/Laboratory Instruments
      Short_Name: In Situ/Laboratory Instruments
   End_Group
End_Group"""@en ;
